    "detailed_description": "<strong>Overview:</strong><br>Operation is very simple<br>This is an action game that uses the left and right movement keys and the jump button to advance.<br><br>There are 3 levels of jump, and each time you press the jump button, the behavior of the jump changes.<br>Use these three jumps to overcome various terrains.<br><br><strong>Story:</strong><br>The main character, Atsumi Minagawa, suddenly feels the urge to go to a hot spring during her day off from work.<br>If she was going to go anyway, she thought, ``I want to go to the best hot spring!''<br>Aiming for a legendary secret hot spring deep in the mountains...<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>- Moderate difficulty level that allows you to aim for clearing even if you are not good at jumping games<br><br>\u30fbThree levels of jump that can be switched by pressing the jump button<br><strong>1st jump: A very small jump</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833390/extras/1a055cdad691afa324825ce1c2a4383c.avif?t=1713401814\" width=600 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong>Second jump: Medium easy runrun jump</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833390/extras/b3d58f6fabc4d3c9a999bc8c7309c4ad.avif?t=1713401814\" width=600 height=308 /></span><br><br><strong>Third stage jump: A very high and energetic super jump</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2833390/extras/3d096b02530a163f45b989ff328d3d5a.avif?t=1713401814\" width=600 height=308 /></span>",
